{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19101","headline":"唐秀才赠端州紫石砚以诗答之 · 刘禹锡","name":"唐秀才赠端州紫石砚以诗答之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"端州石砚人间重，赠我因知正草玄。\n阙里庙堂空旧物，开方竈下岂天然。\n玉蜍吐水霞光静，彩翰摇风绦锦鲜。\n此日佣工记名姓，因君数到墨池前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19101.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19101","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}